<title>USA: Montana Power sees Colstrip 4 up Sunday night.</title>
<headline>Montana Power sees Colstrip 4 up Sunday night.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Montana Power Co said Friday the 700 megawatt (MW) Colstrip 4 coal-fired power unit, which was shut Thursday for maintenance, should be back on line by Sunday night.</p>
<p>The unit was taken off line for repairs to a generator part.</p>
<p>&quot;It will be down for a few days. This is not a major or significant breakdown,&quot; said Montana Power spokesman Dean Conklin.</p>
<p>-- New York Power Desk, + 1 212 859 1628</p>
